# Social Democracy: An Alternate Horizon - SPD Customization Fork

This repo contains the SPD identity customization patch for the Social Democracy mod workflow.

## Added feature

- Sandbox menu option: `SPD Identity`
- Custom SPD party name (1-50 characters)
- Custom SPD color selected via RGB inputs
- Reset to default SPD values
- CSS custom property hooking for the party color (`--spd-party-color`)

## Files added

- `source/scenes/root.scene.dry`
- `source/scenes/sandbox.scene.dry`

## Variables used

- `Q.spd_custom_name`
- `Q.spd_custom_color`
- `Q.get_spd_name()`
- `Q.get_spd_rgb()`
- `Q.get_spd_color()`
- `Q.apply_spd_identity()`

## Default values

- Name: `SPD`
- Color: `rgb(227, 0, 15)`

## Notes

This repo is meant to hold the patch for the mod and is not a full upstream dump of the original game.
